Use link text for inline navigation inside copy. Setting `external` opens the link in a new tab and
adds `rel="noopener noreferrer"`.

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
	import LinkText from '~/components/link-text/link-text.svelte';
</script>

<LinkText href="/pricing">See pricing</LinkText>
<LinkText href="https://example.com" external tone="muted">Read the docs</LinkText>
```
